        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>玫瑰椅图文分析 - 中国古典家具图文分析⑦</title>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    background: #d4cfc4;\n    color: #2a2a2a;\n    padding: 20px;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    padding-bottom: 10px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #999;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .header .from {\n    font-family: \"Brush Script MT\", cursive;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n  .header .avatar {\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 30px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #c0392b;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: white;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .header .source {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .header .xiaohongshu {\n    color: #e74c3c;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .header .series {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n  }\n  .main-content {\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 700px;\n  }\n  .title-block {\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .title-block h1 {\n    font-size: 48px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 8px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .title-block h2 {\n    font-size: 36px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .content-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr 220px;\n    gap: 10px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .left-col {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n  .center-col {\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .right-col {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 15px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-underline-offset: 3px;\n  }\n  .section-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .chair-diagram {\n    width: 320px;\n    height: 420px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .chair-svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n  .label {\n    position: absolute;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .label-top { top: 30px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }\n  .label-right-top { top: 100px; right: -60px; }\n  .label-right-mid { top: 200px; right: -50px; }\n  .label-right-bot { bottom: 60px; right: -50px; }\n  .label-left { top: 180px; left: -70px; }\n  .label-line {\n    position: absolute;\n    background: #333;\n    height: 1px;\n  }\n  .bottom-section {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n  }\n  .bottom-section .section-title {\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .bottom-section .section-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #555;\n    border-top: 1px solid #999;\n    padding-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .chair-placeholder {\n    width: 320px;\n    height: 420px;\n    border: 1px dashed #aaa;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n  }\n  .chair-placeholder svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n  .callout-line {\n    stroke: #333;\n    stroke-width: 1;\n  }\n  .callout-dot {\n    fill: #333;\n  }\n  .label-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    fill: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .right-desc {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .top-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .top-row .left-spacer {\n    width: 220px;\n  }\n  .top-row .center-spacer {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .top-row .right-title {\n    width: 220px;\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n  .middle-row {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr 220px;\n    gap: 10px;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n  .middle-row .left-text {\n    padding-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .middle-row .center-diagram {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .middle-row .right-text {\n    padding-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .label-container {\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .inline-label {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .chair-illustration {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 340px;\n    height: 440px;\n  }\n  .chair-illustration svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n  .abs-label {\n    position: absolute;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <span class=\"from\">From:</span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">清</span>\n  <span class=\"source\">清华博士的古家具美学</span>\n  <span class=\"xiaohongshu\">小红书</span>\n  <span class=\"series\">中国古典家具图文分析⑦</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"top-row\">\n  <div class=\"left-spacer\"></div>\n  <div class=\"center-spacer\"></div>\n  <div class=\"right-title\">\n    <h1>玫瑰椅</h1>\n    <h2>图文分析</h2>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"middle-row\">\n  <div class=\"left-text\">\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">椅背</div>\n      <div class=\"section-text\">\n        低于一般椅背，背高度与扶手高度相差无几，为典型玫瑰椅。此椅因其后背较矮，在居室中陈设较灵活，在靠窗台陈设时不致高出窗台而阻挡视线。因用材纤细轻巧，便于搬动，摆法灵活，所以成为明清富豪家中常设座椅。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section-title\">卡子花</div>\n      <div class=\"section-text\">\n        明清家具部件名称，为家具雕花饰件，是卡在两条横枨之间的花饰。多用在\"矮老\"的位置，实际是装饰化了的矮老。多数是用木材镂雕纹样，也有用嵌玉卡子花等其他材料，常用的有双环卡子花、单环卡子花、枫叶卡子花等。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"center-diagram\">\n    <div class=\"chair-illustration\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 440\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <!-- Chair back top rail -->\n        <rect x=\"80\" y=\"40\" width=\"180\" height=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <!-- Chair back uprights -->\n        <rect x=\"80\" y=\"40\" width=\"8\" height=\"160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <rect x=\"252\" y=\"40\" width=\"8\" height=\"160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <!-- Chair back middle rail -->\n        <rect x=\"80\" y=\"120\" width=\"180\" height=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <!-- Carved decoration on back (透雕花饰) -->\n        <rect x=\"140\" y=\"50\" width=\"60\" height=\"65\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <path d=\"M155 60 Q170 55 185 60 Q190 75 185 90 Q170 95 155 90 Q150 75 155 60Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <path d=\"M160 70 Q170 67 180 70 Q183 80 180 88 Q170 91 160 88 Q157 80 160 70Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/>\n        <!-- Armrests -->\n        <rect x=\"60\" y=\"130\" width=\"30\" height=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <rect x=\"250\" y=\"130\" width=\"30\" height=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <!-- Armrest supports -->\n        <rect x=\"60\" y=\"130\" width=\"8\" height=\"70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <rect x=\"272\" y=\"130\" width=\"8\" height=\"70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <!-- Seat -->\n        <rect x=\"60\" y=\"195\" width=\"220\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n        <!-- Seat frame -->\n        <rect x=\"60\" y=\"207\" width=\"220\" height=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <!-- 卡子花 decorations under seat -->\n        <rect x=\"100\" y=\"220\" width=\"20\" height=\"25\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <rect x=\"160\" y=\"220\" width=\"20\" height=\"25\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <rect x=\"220\" y=\"220\" width=\"20\" height=\"25\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <!-- Lower rail (横枨) -->\n        <rect x=\"70\" y=\"260\" width=\"200\" height=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <!-- Legs -->\n        <rect x=\"65\" y=\"207\" width=\"10\" height=\"180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <rect x=\"265\" y=\"207\" width=\"10\" height=\"180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <rect x=\"90\" y=\"260\" width=\"8\" height=\"127\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <rect x=\"242\" y=\"260\" width=\"8\" height=\"127\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <!-- Foot stretchers -->\n        <rect x=\"70\" y=\"370\" width=\"200\" height=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <!-- Carved details on legs -->\n        <path d=\"M70 280 Q80 275 90 280\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <path d=\"M250 280 Q260 275 270 280\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <!-- 鼻头榫 detail on armrest end -->\n        <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"134\" r=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n\n        <!-- Callout lines and labels -->\n        <!-- 透雕花饰 -->\n        <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"15\" class=\"callout-line\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"50\" r=\"2\" class=\"callout-dot\"/>\n\n        <!-- 鼻头榫 -->\n        <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"110\" class=\"callout-line\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"134\" r=\"2\" class=\"callout-dot\"/>\n\n        <!-- 横枨 -->\n        <line x1=\"270\" y1=\"263\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"263\" class=\"callout-line\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"263\" r=\"2\" class=\"callout-dot\"/>\n\n        <!-- 腿足 -->\n        <line x1=\"270\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"390\" class=\"callout-line\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"380\" r=\"2\" class=\"callout-dot\"/>\n\n        <!-- 卡子花 -->\n        <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"232\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"232\" class=\"callout-line\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"232\" r=\"2\" class=\"callout-dot\"/>\n      </svg>\n\n      <!-- Labels positioned absolutely -->\n      <div class=\"abs-label\" style=\"top: 0px; left: 130px;\">透雕花饰</div>\n      <div class=\"abs-label\" style=\"top: 95px; right: -55px;\">鼻头榫</div>\n      <div class=\"abs-label\" style=\"top: 253px; right: -50px;\">横枨</div>\n      <div class=\"abs-label\" style=\"bottom: 40px; right: -50px;\">腿足</div>\n      <div class=\"abs-label\" style=\"top: 222px; left: -65px;\">卡子花</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"display:none;\">[Chair diagram: rose chair with labeled parts]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"right-text\">\n    <div class=\"right-desc\">\n      明时玫瑰椅多圆腿或方腿，而清式腿面常用剑脊线，即指中间高，两旁斜仄有如宝剑剑背的线脚。《鲁班经》有\"剑脊线\"。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bottom-section\">\n  <div class=\"section-title\">腿足</div>\n  <div class=\"section-text\">\n    使用雕刻手段装饰家具，最早见于战国。经过两千多年的发展和积累，到明清时期已经非常成熟。明清家具的雕刻手法主要有浮雕、透雕和圆雕。透雕是留出纹样，将底子镂空和全部挖掉，使纹样镂空突出，留出图案还要做成立体效果。透雕可以两面雕，也可以只作一面雕。明式家具小面积的雕、镂、刻、嵌手法中，刀法平稳，有力准确，小巧别致。明式家具上平板多用浮雕。偶尔用透雕。挡板多用透雕。清式家具则广泛使用透雕装饰方法，喜欢在椅子背板、桌案牙条、挡板等部位采用整块透雕，突出剔透、空灵的效果。至清中期以后，雕饰达到了高潮，有时一件家具竟通体满雕。\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"footer\">\n  资料来自：《良工意趣》聂菲、张曦，百花文艺出版社，2016年1月\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
        "reasoning_content": "The user wants me to convert an image of a Chinese document about classical furniture (specifically a \"Rose Chair\" or 玫瑰椅) into HTML.\n\nLet me analyze the layout:\n\n1. **Header**: \"From: 清华博士的古家具美学 小红书 中国古典家具图文分析⑦\"\n2. **Title**: \"玫瑰椅 图文分析\" (large text, right side)\n3. **Center**: A diagram/illustration of a chair with labeled parts\n4. **Left side text blocks**:\n   - \"椅背\" section - description about the chair back\n   - \"卡子花\" section - description about the decorative element\n5. **Right side text blocks**:\n   - Labels pointing to chair parts: 透雕花饰, 鼻头榫, 横枨, 腿足\n   - Description about 腿足 (legs)\n6. **Bottom**: \"腿足\" section with detailed description\n7. **Footer**: Source information\n\nThe layout has:\n- A header bar at top\n- Title on the upper right\n- A chair diagram in the center with callout lines pointing to various parts\n- Text blocks on the left and right sides\n- A longer text block at the bottom\n\nLet me create this as an HTML page with proper positioning.\n\nThe chair diagram is in the center with labels pointing to different parts:\n- 透雕花饰 (top center, pointing to the carved decoration on the back)\n- 鼻头榫 (right side, pointing to the armrest end)\n- 横枨 (right side, pointing to the horizontal rail)\n- 腿足 (bottom right, pointing to the leg)\n- 卡子花 (left side, pointing to the decorative element between rails)\n\nI'll use a combination of flexbox/grid and absolute positioning to recreate this layout.\n\nLet me structure this carefully:\n\n1. Header row with \"From:\" and the title info\n2. Main content area with:\n   - Left column: 椅背 text, 卡子花 text\n   - Center: Chair diagram (placeholder) with labels\n   - Right column: Title \"玫瑰椅 图文分析\", 腿足 description text\n3. Bottom: 腿足 detailed description\n4. Footer: source info\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the layout:\n\n- Top: Header bar\n- Upper right: Large title \"玫瑰椅 图文分析\"\n- Center: Chair illustration with callout labels\n- Left side: 椅背 description (